WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.573 --> 00:00:01.719
- You might have seen
the picture going around

00:00:01.719 --> 00:00:05.328
Twitter of the dude who
put candy corn on pizza.

00:00:05.328 --> 00:00:07.062
When I saw it, I called it literally the

00:00:07.062 --> 00:00:09.241
worst thing on the internet.

00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:10.349
Naturally, people tweeted me back

00:00:10.349 --> 00:00:11.635
saying they wanted to try it and that it's

00:00:11.635 --> 00:00:12.867
probably pretty good.

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:15.136
So, that's what we're doing today.

00:00:15.136 --> 00:00:17.719
Taste testing candy corn pizza.

00:00:20.049 --> 00:00:23.299
(dramatic piano music)

