00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:14.786
- It's not terrible.

00:02:14.786 --> 00:02:16.948
It's not terrible.

00:02:16.948 --> 00:02:18.501
- I still don't like candy corn.

00:02:18.501 --> 00:02:19.995
